# Pysical things and modules

sound: Sound
sound.shape: step
rp: RP Pico
max: MAX4466 Module
nokia_display: Nokia 5110 Screen
ledstrip: NeoPixel LED Strip
shifter: 3.3V to 5V TTL shifter
5v: External 5V supply

rp: {
  audio: |md
  ### Audio module
  Roles:
  - Performs FFT on sampled audio via MAX4466 Module
  - Presents a clean API to other modules which can use this data
  |
  audio.shape: rectangle
  
  display: |md
  ### Display module
  Roles:
  - Uses data from Audio module and visualizes it
  - TODO: Specify possible other features
  |
  display.shape: rectangle
  
  led: |md
  ### LED controller module
  Roles:
  - Uses data from Audio module and visualizes it via \
  LED strip
  - TODO: Specify visual format
  |
  led.shape: rectangle
}

sound -> max
max-> rp.audio

rp.audio -> rp.display
rp.audio -> rp.led

rp.display -> nokia_display
rp.led -> shifter -> ledstrip
5v -> ledstrip
5v <-> rp: Share common ground

(5v <-> rp)[0].style.stroke: black
